# Collector contract

Every collector subclasses `BaseCollector` and implements `name`, `allowed_domains`, `fetch()`, `parse()`, `to_records()`.

Every collector MUST write exactly one `source_runs` row per execution, on success and on failure.

Every collector MUST call the robots gate before every fetch.

Every collector MUST have at least one saved fixture in `backend/tests/fixtures/` and a test that fails when the parser returns zero records for a fixture that previously returned records.

Collector failures are caught, logged to `source_runs` with `status = failed`, and must not crash the scheduler.

Do not add a data source unless a prompt specifies it.
